cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Democracy Bench"
authors:
  - family-names: Beltran
    given-names: Alejandro
type: software
license: MIT
year: 2026
repository-code: "https://github.com/PLACEHOLDER/democracy-bench"
abstract: >-
  A survey-grounded evaluation harness that asks, across a ladder of
  alignment levers (context, decode, activation, weights, scaffold), whether
  an LLM can carry per-item public democratic preference while holding
  rights floors. Scored with a two-axis instrument (representation and
  tracking elasticity) over public-opinion and values-survey targets.
